{"id":"natsumi_expression_25_test","title":"夏海の表情テスト：消えた差し入れフルーツ","version":"v039_321","return":{"mode":"storyMenu","storyMenuTab":"other","storyId":"natsumi_expression_25_test","eventId":"natsumi_expression_25_test"},"format":"v039_steps","renderPolicy":{"background":"forceReplace","sprites":"storyOnly","forceCenterSprites":true},"summary":"販売勝負後、休憩用に用意した差し入れフルーツを店長と探しながら、夏海の正式25表情を順番に確認する表示確認用シナリオ。","testPurpose":"日向 夏海の採用済み正式25表情について、最新manifestの画像パスで表示、切替、透過、位置、トリミングを一巡確認する。","steps":[{"bg":"images/assets/bg/battle_store_lv1.png","speaker":"","text":"【表情テスト】夏海と消えた差し入れフルーツ","bgMode":"forceReplace","clearStorySprites":true,"forceBackgroundReplace":true},{"speaker":"","text":"販売勝負のあと。ひだまりストアに残った店長と、ビリビリ電機の夏海は少しだけ居残っていた。"},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［01/25 澄まし］店長さん、お疲れさまです～。あちし、みんなで食べようと思って差し入れ持ってきたんです。","expressionId":"01","expressionLabel":"澄まし","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_01_composed.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［02/25 やさしい微笑み］店長さんも一緒に食べます？　いっぱいあるから遠慮しなくて大丈夫ですよ～。","expressionId":"02","expressionLabel":"やさしい微笑み","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_02_gentle_smile.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［03/25 笑顔］今日はフルーツ盛り合わせです♪　小春ちゃんも真冬ちゃんも喜ぶかな～。","expressionId":"03","expressionLabel":"笑顔","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_03_smile.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［04/25 怒り］……あれ？　ない。ここに置いた袋がないです～。","expressionId":"04","expressionLabel":"怒り","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_04_anger.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［05/25 軽い嫌悪］食べ物を粗末にするのは、あちしちょっと悲しいですよぉ。","expressionId":"05","expressionLabel":"軽い嫌悪","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_05_mild_disgust.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［06/25 悲しみ］せっかくみんなで食べようと思ったのになぁ……しょんぼりです。","expressionId":"06","expressionLabel":"悲しみ","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_06_sadness.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［07/25 心配／不安］冷蔵庫に入れ忘れたかな？　傷んでたらどうしよう……。","expressionId":"07","expressionLabel":"心配／不安","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_07_worry.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［08/25 動揺］わっ、店長さん！　その箱、急に動きましたよぉ！？","expressionId":"08","expressionLabel":"動揺","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_08_agitated.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［09/25 驚き］あら～、下から保冷バッグが出てきました。びっくり。","expressionId":"09","expressionLabel":"驚き","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_09_surprise.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［10/25 照れ］店長さん、そんなに近くで覗くと……ちょっと照れますよぉ。","expressionId":"10","expressionLabel":"照れ","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_10_shy.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［11/25 期待］もしかして、この中に入ってるかな？　わくわくしてきました♪","expressionId":"11","expressionLabel":"期待","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_11_expectation.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［12/25 得意げ］あちし、食べ物の気配には強いんですよ～。えへん。","expressionId":"12","expressionLabel":"得意げ","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_12_proud.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［13/25 いたずらな笑顔・舌出しウィンク］じゃーん♪　開ける前に中身を当ててみます？　ぺろっ。","expressionId":"13","expressionLabel":"いたずらな笑顔・舌出しウィンク","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_13_playful_tongue_wink.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［14/25 いたずらな笑顔・歯見せウィンク］当たったら一個多くあげますよ～。あちしも一個多く食べますけど♪","expressionId":"14","expressionLabel":"いたずらな笑顔・歯見せウィンク","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_14_playful_toothy_wink.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［15/25 困り笑い］あれぇ、保冷剤だけ。フルーツさん、かくれんぼ上手ですねぇ。","expressionId":"15","expressionLabel":"困り笑い","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_15_troubled_smile.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［16/25 真剣／決意］よーし。食べ物のことなら、あちしも本気で探しますよ～。","expressionId":"16","expressionLabel":"真剣／決意","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_16_determined.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［17/25 伏し目／余韻］みんなで食べるつもりだったから、一人で見つけてもあんまり嬉しくないんですよね。","expressionId":"17","expressionLabel":"伏し目／余韻","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_17_downcast_afterglow.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［18/25 拗ね／ぷいっ］……べつに食いしん坊だから必死なんじゃないですよぉ。ほんとです。","expressionId":"18","expressionLabel":"拗ね／ぷいっ","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_18_sulking.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［19/25 泣き笑い］ありました～！　よかったぁ。ちゃんと冷蔵庫の奥に入ってました♪","expressionId":"19","expressionLabel":"泣き笑い","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_19_tearful_smile.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［20/25 無言の圧／見透かす］店長さん……最初から冷蔵庫の奥、見えてたんじゃないですか～？","expressionId":"20","expressionLabel":"無言の圧／見透かす","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_20_silent_pressure.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［21/25 黒い笑顔］ふふふ。もし黙ってたなら、店長さんの分だけ一口サイズにしちゃいますよ～。","expressionId":"21","expressionLabel":"黒い笑顔","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_21_dark_smile.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［22/25 安堵］でも一緒に探してくれてありがとうございました。さ、みんなで食べましょ♪","expressionId":"22","expressionLabel":"安堵","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_22_relieved.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［23/25 見惚れ／ときめき］店長さんが美味しそうに食べてると、あちしまで嬉しくなりますねぇ。","expressionId":"23","expressionLabel":"見惚れ／ときめき","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_23_captivated.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［24/25 眠そう］いっぱい動いたら眠くなってきました～。食べたらもっと眠くなりそう。","expressionId":"24","expressionLabel":"眠そう","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_24_sleepy.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"日向 夏海","text":"［25/25 照れ隠し怒り］もぉ～、寝そうって笑わないでくださいよぉ。店長さんもちゃんと一緒に食べるんですから♪","expressionId":"25","expressionLabel":"照れ隠し怒り","storySprites":[{"id":"bc","src":"images/assets/char/bc_natsumi/standing/bc_natsumi_expression_25_bashful_anger.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(68dvh, 700px)"}]},{"speaker":"","text":"（夏海の25表情をすべて確認しました）"}]}
